<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Minproc year net loss A$26.22 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Minproc year net loss A$26.22 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		loss 8.06 vs profit 8.70</p>
<p>    Net				loss 26.22 vs profit 4.66</p>
